{"detail": {"templateUuid": "1488de8d50dc4ee680a667686ca729a0", "projectUuid": "e40c9135db8e47c295f37591e0a08968", "name": "当东坡居士遇上仿冒客服", "description": "《当东坡居士遇上仿冒客服》以古今错位的幽默方式，讲述苏东坡意外进入现代数字生活后，遭遇“仿冒客服”诈骗的故事。画面中，东坡居士手持手机，面对看似专业、话术熟练的“客服”来电，从最初的疑惑到逐渐识破骗局，展现出他豁达机智、善于思辨的一面。作品将宋代文人气质与现代反诈场景结合，用轻松诙谐的表达提醒观众：诈骗手段虽不断翻新，但保持冷静、不轻信、不转账、不透露个人信息，才是守住钱袋子的关键。整体风格既有古风意趣，又带有现代网络安全教育意味，让反诈宣传更有故事感和传播力。", "coverUrl": "/assets/d82f9f920a6604bb.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/a1817ad7926b47b4be1cf2ba8f111dfc/833d90b44c52d92cf7d142047670e625a91c259c.mp4", "snapshotId": 10921, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 7920080, "ownerUuid": "a1817ad7926b47b4be1cf2ba8f111dfc", "avatar": "/assets/976568cde01719c4.webp", "nickname": "文达AI", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 14, "tags": [{"id": 3031, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "大乱斗｜vol.1 显形记", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3031/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 3034, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "3-创意与超现实", "parentTag": 3031, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3031/3034", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 1506, "code": "rule_demo", "tagLabel": "规则演示", "parentTag": 1500, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1500/1506/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 6, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}], "userTags": [{"tagId": 5001, "name": "先锋", "icon": "/assets/15bcb4d002b68470.webp", "primaryIcon": "/assets/b40570481582e92f.webp", "desc": "LibTV先锋作者", "verifyLevel": 1}], "score": 0, "socialMediaUrl": "8.23 :9pm O@k.Pk 05/29 icn:/ 东坡居士这次当美食博主还是反诈博主？“企业账号”有猫腻！ # 抖音反诈 # 反诈 # 抖音客服 # 苏轼 # 五一  https://v.douyin.com/xjD854RcGnM/ 复制此链接，打开Dou音搜索，直接观看视频！", "createAt": "2026年05月13日 17:43", "updateAt": "2026年06月01日 17:02", "publishAt": "2026年05月13日 17:43", "playCount": 24, "viewCreationProcessCount": 7, "copyCanvasCount": 1, "shareCount": 0, "snapshotPath": "/data/canvas-snapshots/1488de8d50dc4ee680a667686ca729a0.json.gz", "snapshotSummary": {"